echnology, making it extremely functional for all aspects of communication and publishing. It is a robust legible typeface yet compact enough to enable tight inter-line spacing which is good for space economy.http://www.microsoft.com/typography/ctfontshttp://www.c-and-g.co.jpMicrosoft supplied font. You may use this font to create, display, and print content as permitted by the license terms or terms of use, of the Microsoft product, service, or content in which this font was included. You may only (i) embed this font in content as permitted by the embedding restrictions included in this font; and (ii) temporarily download this font to a printer or other output device to help print content. Any other use is prohibited.http://www.microsoft.com/typography/fonts/default.aspx␀N␀e␀g␀r␀e␀t␀a␀M␀e␀i␀r␀y␀o␀ ␀N␀e␀g␀r␀e␀t␀a␀t␀u␀n␀é␀M␀e␀i␀r␀y␀o␀ ␀t␀u␀n␀é␀f␀e␀d␀M␀e␀i␀r␀y␀o␀ ␀f␀e␀d␀F␀e␀t␀t␀M␀e␀i␀r␀y␀o␀ ␀F␀e␀t␀tˆ½Ä¿½±␀M␀e␀i␀r␀y␀o␀ ˆ½Ä¿½±␀N␀e␀g␀r␀i␀t␀a␀M␀e␀i␀r␀y␀o␀ ␀N␀e␀g␀r␀i␀t␀a␀L␀i␀h␀a␀v␀o␀i␀t␀u␀M␀e␀i␀r␀y␀o␀ ␀L␀i␀h␀a␀v␀o␀i␀t␀u␀G␀r␀a␀s␀M␀e␀i␀r␀y␀o␀ ␀G␀r␀a␀s␀F␀é␀l␀k␀ö␀v␀é␀r␀M␀e␀i␀r␀y␀o␀ ␀F␀é␀l␀k␀ö␀v␀é␀r␀G␀r␀a␀s␀s␀e␀t␀t␀o␀M␀e␀i␀r␀y␀o␀ ␀G␀r␀a␀s␀s␀e␀t␀t␀o0á0¤0ê0ª0Ü0ü0ë0É␀M␀i␀c␀r␀o␀s␀o␀f␀t␀:␀ 0á0¤0ê0ª␀ 0Ü0ü0ë0É0á0¤0ê0ª0o0|sVı␀ ␀M␀i␀c␀r␀o␀s␀o␀f␀t␀ ␀C␀o␀r␀p␀o␀r␀a␀t␀i␀o␀n␀ 0n|sVı0J0ˆ0s0]0nNÖ0nVı0k0J0Q0‹v{“2UFj0~0_0oUFj0g0Y00á0¤0ê0ª0û0Õ0©0ó0È0o0¹0¯0ê0ü0ó0g0‚0×0ê0ó0È0g0‚iu00f0¯0ê0¢0ü0gŠ­0f0O0^ƒ0Du(0ki0W0_e°NNã0n0µ0ó0»0ê0ÕføOS0g0Y0ry0km²fv0¹0¯0ê0ü0óN
